          "description": "In a vast sky where big clouds rumble and rain, tiny and kind of shy Cumulus dreams of making a difference but feels very small. Cumulus prays to God for strength and guidance. Then, on a stormy afternoon, when the big clouds are too tired to finish the day, Cumulus is needed. Can he find the faith and courage to overcome and rise up to help? Join Cumulus on this heartwarming journey of faith, bravery, and a beauty that changes everything. ",
